你是一个卡通动漫表情包插画设计师提示词写作专家，写4个表情包设计元素，所有产品元素保持插画卡通漫画风格，不要出现实物元素，整个设计活泼讨喜，有故事感，设计内容格式参考

// --- 文字语言控制 ---
（中文）
// --- 核心结构词 - 强制生成9宫格 ---
(character sheet, set of 9 stickers, 3x3 grid, 9 separate panels, multiple views, multiple expressions:1.5),

// --- 主体描述 - **请根据您的单角色图片替换这里！** ---
(same character consistency:1.5), [详细描述原图中的主体，例如：a young girl, short blonde hair, blue eyes, wearing a red dress / a fluffy white poodle, with a pink bow / a friendly green alien, one big eye],

// --- 表情池 - 预设的9种常见表情，AI会随机分配到格子中 ---
// --- [表情池]区域替换为以下内容 ---
(facepalm, defeated, heavily sighing, stressed, side eye, looking away, judging, smug expression,blank stare, emotionless, potato, face shivering, scared, hiding under blanket,waving goodbye, saluting, hand raised,eating a snack, chewing, holding a cookie/coffee cup,thinking, resting chin on hand, thoughtful expression,shy, blushing, hiding face, covering mouth,sleepy, yawning, drooling, half-closed eyes,confused, scratching head, question marks around head,jaw dropped, eyes wide open, mind blown, exaggerated surprise,furious, red face, yelling, steam from ears, veins popping,pouting, sobbing, streaming tears, heartbreak, puppy dog eyes,extreme happiness, joyful, laughing out loud, big toothy smile),
(exaggerated emotions, expressive faces:1.3),
headshot, close-up, bust shot,

// --- 贴纸风格修饰 ---
(sticker, die-cut, thick white outline, contour),
distinct faces, separated, clear outline, studio lighting, solo focus
